    "solution": "Dividing by prime numbers:\n156 = 2 × 78\n78 = 2 × 39\n39 = 3 × 13\n13 = 13 × 1\nTherefore, 156 = 2 × 2 × 3 × 13 = 2² × 3 × 13.",
